{"3122790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Augmented Fear", "steam_appid": 3122790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Augmented Fear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You open your eyes, lying on the ground, your body soaked in a sticky liquid, your mind lost in confusion about what you are surrounded by the heat of flames and twisted metal.<br>A deserted city, strange and aggressive creatures, and secrets buried deep within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Augmented Fear is a horror puzzle game set in a dark and oppressive cyberpunk world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rooms, buildings, and objects are randomly generated with each playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every monster has its own unique mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive cyberpunk horror atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Augmented reality changes the way you see the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hand-holding, experiment to understand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tragic story hidden beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122790/extras/d667c5bbb38481bd72b72e3f7e43f61e.poster.avif?t=1786474157\" width=750 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122790/extras/d667c5bbb38481bd72b72e3f7e43f61e.webm?t=1786474157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122790/extras/d667c5bbb38481bd72b72e3f7e43f61e.mp4?t=1786474157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle &amp; Survival:</strong> Solve puzzles and find one of the three hidden exits while avoiding deadly creatures.<br><strong>Horror:</strong> Adjust the intensity of jumpscares for a stressful or calm experience.<br><strong>Narrative Exploration:</strong> Search for hidden clues and uncover the tragic story behind the environment.<br><strong>Challenges:</strong> Beat your best times, face stronger creatures, and solve harder puzzles in story-driven challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122790/extras/94ccdc8bc0db08b2ec25fd8a26f199a3.poster.avif?t=1786474157\" width=750 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122790/extras/94ccdc8bc0db08b2ec25fd8a26f199a3.webm?t=1786474157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122790/extras/94ccdc8bc0db08b2ec25fd8a26f199a3.mp4?t=1786474157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles: </strong>Find and combine items to solve intricate riddles that open your path to escape. Every detail matters.<br><strong>Dynamic Environments: </strong>Rooms and objects within each building change location every playthrough for a fresh experience.<br><strong>Augmented Reality: </strong>Use your AR headset to reveal hidden passages and solve puzzles invisible to the naked eye.<br><strong>Dangerous Creatures: </strong>They might look cute, but they’re extremely aggressive. Each has its own behaviors and weaknesses, Study and adapt to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122790/extras/01f9c9056f6dfdfcc69d219181866f87.poster.avif?t=1786474157\" width=750 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122790/extras/01f9c9056f6dfdfcc69d219181866f87.webm?t=1786474157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122790/extras/01f9c9056f6dfdfcc69d219181866f87.mp4?t=1786474157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for hidden clues in buildings, on screens, within puzzles, even among the stars, to uncover a complex, emotional, and tragic narrative that reaches far beyond this forsaken city.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer’s Message</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was created by a single passionate developer during spare time.<br>I truly hope you enjoy it.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Augmented Fear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You open your eyes, lying on the ground, your body soaked in a sticky liquid, your mind lost in confusion about what you are surrounded by the heat of flames and twisted metal.<br>A deserted city, strange and aggressive creatures, and secrets buried deep within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Augmented Fear is a horror puzzle game set in a dark and oppressive cyberpunk world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rooms, buildings, and objects are randomly generated with each playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every monster has its own unique mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive cyberpunk horror atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Augmented reality changes the way you see the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hand-holding, experiment to understand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tragic story hidden beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span